Zero-or-more & \texttt{p\allowbreak{}.\allowbreak{}m\allowbreak{}a\allowbreak{}n\allowbreak{}y\allowbreak{}(\allowbreak{})} /\allowbreak{} \texttt{m\allowbreak{}a\allowbreak{}n\allowbreak{}y\allowbreak{}(\allowbreak{}p\allowbreak{})} \\
Optional & \texttt{p\allowbreak{}.\allowbreak{}o\allowbreak{}p\allowbreak{}t\allowbreak{}i\allowbreak{}o\allowbreak{}n\allowbreak{}a\allowbreak{}l\allowbreak{}(\allowbreak{})} /\allowbreak{} \texttt{o\allowbreak{}p\allowbreak{}t\allowbreak{}i\allowbreak{}o\allowbreak{}n\allowbreak{}a\allowbreak{}l\allowbreak{}(\allowbreak{}p\allowbreak{})} \\
Backtracking & \texttt{t\allowbreak{}r\allowbreak{}y\allowbreak{}\_\allowbreak{}\allowbreak{}p\allowbreak{}a\allowbreak{}r\allowbreak{}s\allowbreak{}e\allowbreak{}(\allowbreak{}p\allowbreak{})} \\
Expected-label replacement & \texttt{l\allowbreak{}a\allowbreak{}b\allowbreak{}e\allowbreak{}l\allowbreak{}e\allowbreak{}d\allowbreak{}(\allowbreak{}p\allowbreak{},\allowbreak{}\ \allowbreak{}l\allowbreak{}a\allowbreak{}b\allowbreak{}e\allowbreak{}l\allowbreak{})} \\
Whole-source execution & \texttt{r\allowbreak{}u\allowbreak{}n\allowbreak{}\_\allowbreak{}\allowbreak{}p\allowbreak{}a\allowbreak{}r\allowbreak{}s\allowbreak{}e\allowbreak{}r\allowbreak{}(\allowbreak{}p\allowbreak{},\allowbreak{}\ \allowbreak{}s\allowbreak{}o\allowbreak{}u\allowbreak{}r\allowbreak{}c\allowbreak{}e\allowbreak{})} \\
